      "summary_sent_score": 0.22795362770557404
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Since there is a dispute with regard to apportionment of the compensation, the Competent Authority, Land Acquisition in exercise of power under Section 20-H(4) of the Act, deposited the amount with learned Civil Judge (Senior Division), Sundargarh, but the land situates within the local jurisdiction of learned Civil Judge (Senior Division), Rourkela.",
